      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I had a somewhat difficult installation location (insulated roof panelling). All of the other low cost installers couldn't make it work, but DJ Solar new of appropriate brackets etc and were a competitive price.DJ Solar subcontracted the install out as expected, however the installers had never used the model of inverter or brackets before. The brackets weren't installed properly (missing half the screws) and the inverter was installed without a DC isolator (my model of inverter didn't have an inbuilt one). The system was also installed prior to contacting energex and getting approval for the installation. I also had to largely commission the system myself as the installer didn't know how or have the write passwords etc.They fixed all the issues promptly when I complained, but most people wouldn't have been to identify the problems with the install.",
