      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sales Quoting processas I knew what I wanted and had spoken to several solar companies prior, I had a good idea of what would fit on my roof, DJ Solar provided many brands and configurations for me to choose from. I used SolarQuotes brand reviews to select some that I was comfortable with.Install Day 1as it was quite a big system and they were replacing an existing system, it was broken up into two days.the installers arrived on time and were polite and kept the install tidyInstall Day 2All went well, they brought a 3rd installer to do the board while the other two finished the system (we had a big storm expected in the afternoon, so I think they were trying to finish ahead of that)By 4pm it was online and generating 2500kw (just as the storm and it dropped to 600 :( )I had been looking for a solar company that delivered a high quality product and install for a competitive price, I am happy that I went with DJ Solar.",
